  "description": "<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Baskerville; color: rgb(8, 10, 12);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">For centuries Native Americans would trek to a remote desert canyon near the Idaho-Nevada border to drink and collect the naturally sweet geothermal spring water they believe to be Sacred Healing Water.  Aquene Springs Source Water comes to us as a perfected gift from the inner part of Mother Earth where it is naturally filtered and purified.  It is collected, never pumped, and boxed at the source before it reaches the earth’s atmosphere so it can be brought to you in its purest form.</span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Baskerville; color: rgb(8, 10, 12);\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Baskerville; color: rgb(8, 10, 12);\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Baskerville; color: rgb(8, 10, 12);\">Air is the most important element for life on earth, closely followed by water, with food a distant third. The more we understand about human health, the clearer it becomes that water is a crucial element. Humans are 99.999% water, molecularly. The water in our bodies needs constant replenishment and as such healthful longevity is linked to the <i>quality</i> of water we consume.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Baskerville; min-height: 16px;\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Baskerville; color: rgb(8, 10, 12);\">Aquene Springs was founded with the vision that a very special water was put here to nourish, heal and sustain those fortunate enough to find it. </p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Baskerville; color: rgb(8, 10, 12);\"><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Baskerville; color: rgb(8, 10, 12);\">Aquene Springs Source Water’s naturally high silica content promotes: <span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Arial; min-height: 16px;\"><br></p><p class=\"p6\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Baskerville;\"> - Increased cardio-vascular and lung function</p><p class=\"p6\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Baskerville;\"> - Pain relief</p><p class=\"p6\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Baskerville;\"> - Blood circulation</p><p class=\"p6\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Baskerville;\"> - Bone and connective tissue strength</p><p class=\"p6\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; font-variant-num